WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.150
A tiny green light at the end of a dock.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.540
On a far lawn, a figure stretches
out his arms towards it.

3
00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:10.640
All Nick can see is "a single green light,

4
00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:13.170
minute and far away".

5
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:17.880
Then, over grey ash heaps,
an oculist's faded billboard.

6
00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:21.210
Two giant blue eyes, and no face.

7
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.520
A lamp, and an advert.

8
00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:25.980
So why do they matter so much?

9
00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:30.220
In this mission, you'll learn the
difference between a symbol and a motif.

10
00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:33.700
You'll follow the green light from
the first chapter to the fifth,

11
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.580
and watch the eyes brood over the valley.

12
00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:39.410
And you'll find colour at work too: green,

13
00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:42.130
white, gold and grey.

14
00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:45.580
Your mission: work out
why they matter so much.
